---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import { PARTNERSHIPS, SITE } from "../data/site";
---

<Base title="Company" description="MOQOM Cloud is built by elliottwave.studio lab. Elliott Wave LLC owns all intellectual property in MOQOM.">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Company"
    title="MOQOM is built by elliottwave.studio lab."
    lede="MOQOM stands for Media Over QUIC Orchestration Mesh: a relay, a control plane and client SDKs for real-time video on the IETF's Media over QUIC standard."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow stack">
      <p class="reveal">
        We started MOQOM because real-time video had become a choice between building it yourself and renting a black
        box priced per minute. Media over QUIC is a better foundation: an open standard, designed for relays, that
        runs in browsers and native apps alike. We wrote our own implementation of it so that latency, encryption and
        cost are under our control rather than inherited from someone else's stack.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        MOQOM began as a way to test <a href="https://github.com/microsoft/mlvc" rel="noopener">MLVC ↗</a>,
        Microsoft's learned video codec. Development started the same day Microsoft released it, in July 2026.
        MLVC's encoder and decoder aren't fully ready yet, so MOQOM runs on the device's hardware codecs, H.264
        and HEVC. Of those, HEVC was the fastest in our tests.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        Our pricing follows the same idea. You pay what delivery actually costs, plus a margin we state openly, and never
        more than Agora's list price for the same tier.
      </p>
      <p class="reveal">
        MOQOM is automated and turnkey, like every company out of the lab. Signup, billing, top-ups, API keys and
        spend limits are self-serve, with no sales call and no onboarding project. When you need a person, support is
        there, from the people who built it: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contact}`}>{SITE.contact}</a>.
      </p>

      <div class="glass card founder reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow parent-eyebrow">Founder</span>
        <p class="founder-line">Elliott — Founder of elliottwave.studio lab and Elliott Wave LLC.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="reveal">Ownership</h2>
      <p class="reveal">
        Elliott Wave LLC, founded and solely owned by Elliott, owns all intellectual property in MOQOM — the open-source
        SDKs included. An open-source licence lets you use the code; it does not transfer ownership. Patents pending.
      </p>

      <h2 class="reveal">Partnerships</h2>
      <p class="reveal">{PARTNERSHIPS}</p>

      <div class="grid grid-2 links">
        <a class="glass glass--interactive card link reveal" href={SITE.parent} rel="noopener">
          <span class="eyebrow parent-eyebrow">Built by</span>
          <h2>{SITE.parentName} ↗</h2>
          <p class="small muted">elliottwave.studio</p>
        </a>
        <a class="glass glass--interactive card link reveal" href={SITE.docs} rel="noopener">
          <span class="eyebrow">Developers</span>
          <h2>Documentation ↗</h2>
          <p class="small muted">moqom.dev</p>
        </a>
        <a class="glass glass--interactive card link reveal" href={SITE.contribute} rel="noopener">
          <span class="eyebrow">Open source</span>
          <h2>Contribute ↗</h2>
          <p class="small muted">moqom.dev/community/contributing</p>
        </a>
        <a class="glass glass--interactive card link reveal" href={SITE.donate} rel="noopener">
          <span class="eyebrow">Support</span>
          <h2>Donate ↗</h2>
          <p class="small muted">elliottwave.dev/donate</p>
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        Sales, partnerships and press: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contact}`}>{SITE.contact}</a>. Security reports:
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.security}`}>{SITE.security}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .links {
    margin-block: var(--space-6);
  }
  .link {
    color: inherit;
  }
  .link:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .link h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
  }
  .parent-eyebrow {
    color: var(--parent);
  }
  .founder-line {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .stack h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
  }
</style>
